 ## 6\. AI Component

 The AI should not just be a chatbot placed on top of a budgeting app.

 It can have several specialized functions:

 ### Natural-language expense entry

 User:

 > “Spent 350 rupees on dinner yesterday.”

 AI converts this into:

```
{
  "amount": 350,
  "category": "Food",
  "description": "Dinner",
  "date": "yesterday"
}
```

 ### Financial Q&A

 User:

 > “Where did most of my money go this month?”

 AI analyzes transaction data and responds with a summary.

 ### Recommendation engine

 Inputs:

```
Income
Expenses
Budget
Goals
Spending trends
Upcoming bills
```

 Output:

```
Insight
→ Explanation
→ Suggested action
→ Expected budget impact
```

