 ### Strong project direction

 For a college/final-year project, I would structure the project around **three major innovations**:

 **1\. Conversational expense management**\
 → “I spent ₹450 on dinner.”

 **2\. Explainable AI recommendations**\
 → “Why am I overspending?”

 **3\. What-if financial simulation**\
 → “What happens to my savings goal if I buy this?”

 That combination gives PocketSmart AI a much stronger project identity than simply building another expense-tracking application.
